{"articleNo":"2888","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2888&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2011학년도 2학기 농어촌출신대학생 학자금융자 신청안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.07.09","hit":"12797","attachments":[{"name":"2011학년도 2학기 농어촌출신대학생학자금융자 세부시행계획.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2888&attachNo=1747"},{"name":"영농종사자 확인서.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2888&attachNo=2727"},{"name":"어업종사자 확인서.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2888&attachNo=2736"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #0000cc; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">2011학년도 2학기 농어촌출신대학생 학자금융자 신청안내 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">1. 신청대상</span> </p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp; <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">- 농어촌지역에 주소를 두고 6개월 이상 거주하고 있는 학부모의 자녀 또는 본인</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 재학생(복학생, 편입생, 재입학생 포함) - 대학원생제외</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">. 성적기준&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 재학생 : 직전학기 평점평균 1.6이상, 12학점이상 이수자-계절학기성적제외</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 졸업학기 학생과 장애우학생은 12학점미만 이수자도 신청 가능&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">3. 신청 및 서류제출 기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2011. 7. 15(금)&nbsp; 18:00까지</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">4. 지원금액</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"> : 등록금(입학금포함) 범위 내 신청액 전액 무이자 융자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">5. 신청방법</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 학자금지원통합시스템(</span><a href=\"http://scholar.kosaf.go.kr/\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">http://www.kosaf.go.kr</span></a><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">) 접속 → 회원가입 또는 로그인→&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 학자금대출안내 → 농어촌출신대학생학자금 → 신청하기 클릭 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 학자금융자 신청양식의 기재사항을 입력 후 증빙서류 확인 후 제출</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;※ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">신청학생은 로그인 후 신청하여야 하며, 약정서 동의 시 공인인증서로&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;재확인함에</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">따라 반드시 학생은 공인인증서 필요</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\">6. 제출서류 : </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">【공통서류】</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"193\" bgcolor=\"#d6d6d6\" height=\"24\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">구&nbsp; 분</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"442\" bgcolor=\"#d6d6d6\" height=\"24\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">제출서류</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt double;