FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">(서류제출)</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"442\" height=\"148\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">① 융자신청서 (포털 신청화면에서 자동출력)</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">② 학부모(보호자)기준 주민등록등본</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">③ 학부모(보호자)기준 가족관계증명서</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">④ 학부모(보호자) 연대채무약정서</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">⑤ 학부모(보호자)기준 인감증명서</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">⑥ 학부모(보호자)기준 신분증 사본</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">【추가제출】 ※ 해당자에 한함</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; 